{"data":{"body":"[P3] Remove the obsolete cleanup-budget contract. `PluginRunner.closeHandlerScopes()` closes scopes synchronously, and invocation completion waits for that owner even with an exhausted runtime budget, as `HandlerScopeHandoffTest` asserts. No timeout or five-seconds-per-plugin reservation is enforced. Plugin authors could rely on a cleanup bound that does not exist. Document the unbounded wait and remove the timeout/reservation claims.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc8AAAABAFXG9w","finding_digest":"7ffc68046b20a7e96ab67486c29cf295615ad3b01b3a5f123e1764bea251fc5a","finding_id":"arf_v1_p76gqbdlect6s2vwosdmfhhssv","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/handler-scoped::lifecycle-contract::bounded-cleanup-guarantee","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/handler-scoped::lifecycle-contract::bounded-cleanup-guarantee","line":23,"observation_digest":"aa86eacbbcaf4e4d31158b91cd1e113c4fd20056e9e9632f73b96147142fb6fc","observation_id":"aro_v1_vkdovs54v5he2mivroi42hqrhr","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/HandlerScoped.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_p76gqbdlect6s2vwosdmfhhssv","published_at":"2026-10-17T00:55:27Z","review_id":"arr_v1_uffrbhj7ifcem3zenrwqf6cexr","reviewed_base_sha":"67bad28cd9ef1b0808bed193f8a15be75ce457ed","reviewed_head_sha":"94105ac56f53423b7865b1a815834e0d13b72116","reviewer":"codex","start_line":19,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_nai4aizcrladbnpxnxosl2lzt6"},"pull_request":{"number":782},"record_id":"art_v1_dyjni3ta4is2ht2exoozkfy4a6","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-17T00:55:27Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
